name: vent-snap
displayName: Vent Snap
author: m3rcur1e
version: "1.0.0"
minGameVersion: "160"
hidden: true
description: "Turbine condensers and vent condensers snap onto steam vents. Hold one (or a schematic with one) near a vent and the placement preview jumps onto it; rotating or flipping the schematic keeps it there. Can be switched off in Settings."
